        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued September 24 at 6:48AM CDT by NWS Green Bay WI</headline>
        <description>Patchy fog is expected across central and north- central
Wisconsin this morning. The fog will be locally dense, with
visibilities around 1/4 mile or less.

If you plan to travel this morning, be alert for rapidly changing
visibilities. If you encounter dense fog, slow down and use your
low beam headlights.
</description>
